==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|VL.|fr}} root *''salāre'', from a change in conjugation of {{etyl|la|fr}} {{term|salire|salīre|lang=la}}, present active infintive of {{term|salio|saliō|I salt|lang=la}}, from {{term|sal|lang=la}}. Compare Italian {{term|salare|lang=it}}, Romanian ''[[săra]]'', Spanish, Portuguese, and Catalan ''[[salar]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Fr-saler.ogg|audio}}
* {{IPA|/sa.le/|lang=fr}}, {{X-SAMPA|/sa.le/}}

===Verb===
{{fr-verb}}

# {{transitive|lang=fr}} to [[salt]]

====Conjugation====
{{fr-conj-er|sal|avoir}}

